{"version":1,"key":"card:20","content":{"id":20,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有的时候我们需要更加精确的类型，例如服务接口返回的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"code","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 字段，它的值是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"0","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 或者 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"1","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，这种时候应如何声明类型"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"interface Response {\n  code: number;\n  status: string;\n}","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"a580e714-cc38-4896-b531-69938da5589f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果直接声明为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"number","code":true},{"text":" 类型，范围却有些大了，我们可以使用字面量类型，是的，字面量不仅仅可以是值，还可以作为类型","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"// num 的类型为字面量类型 0，它的值只能为字面量 0\nlet num: 0 = 0;\n// 下面的赋值是不可以的，因为 1 不是字面量 0 类型\nnum = 1;","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"b2341578-56dc-4523-8027-452e7f9a644b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果希望可以是多个类型，可以使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"|","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 将类型结合起来"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"// num 既可以是 0，也可以是 1\nlet num: 0 | 1 = 0;\nnum = 1;","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"3ef14acb-3d6e-4d46-9d93-f2ea4dccf4dd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"|","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以将两个类型结合起来，形成一个新的类型，因此服务的接口可以写为"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"interface Response {\n  code: 0 | 1;\n  status: 'success' | 'fail';\n}","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"07f2f83f-4a13-40bb-95d6-3cfc47a1234b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["TypeScript/联合"],"createTime":1688914104706,"updateTime":1752923933197,"linkedCards":[{"id":9,"target":{"key":"card:9","type":"card","id":9},"summary":"联合类型作为泛型传递时，其内容会进行分发 // 2 type A = string | number extends number ? 1 : 2; type B<T> = T extends number ? 1 : 2; // 1 | ...","tags":["TypeScript/联合","TypeScript/分布式特性"]},{"id":12,"target":{"key":"card:12","type":"card","id":12},"summary":"如果一个值可能是多种类型中的某一个，可以使用 | 将类型连接起来 type StrOrNum = string | number; const s: StrOrNum = \"1\"; const n: StrOrNum = 1; 你可以在联合...","tags":["TypeScript/联合","TypeScript/数据类型"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1752923933197}}